through which water is supplied for drinking purpose;
(14)
"Sink" with all its grammatical variations and cognate expressions in relation to a well includes any drilling boring or
digging of a new well or deepening carried out to an existing well;
(15)
"State" means the State of Andhra Pradesh;
(16)
"Surface water" means water occurring on the land surface in ponds, lakes, streams and rivers;
(17)
Technical Officer' means a subject specialist to designated by the Authority to give advice on technical matters;
(18)
To fell a tree' includes burning, cutting, debarking girdling and release of harmful chemicals and such other operations
which cause damage to any part of the tree;
